  "verifiedReasoning": [
    "Both real hooks await exactly one reader, validate owner (and workspace for roster), then return that same snapshot without cached-row merge or another client read.",
    "observeListRead only adds requestedAt to that snapshot and carries its existing proof to the shallow wrapper.",
    "Native proof is captured after encodeArgs and the current-scope assertion, immediately before fetch. The Web endpoint cannot capture it.",
    "A validated, ordered successful batch item receives only the current envelope proof for its own decoded value.result, after current(item); the server Promise.all preserves input order.",
    "Invalid item shapes, individual errors, stale generations, workspace changes and retired caller guards retain their prior rejection paths.",
    "The existing observer still requires the actual committed SWR object, successful original callbacks, current cache/key identity, readiness/generation coverage and required revisions.",
    "No proof is attached to merged issue/thread/chat results; their original revalidation behavior remains."
  ],
